    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With quantities",
     "texto": [
      "**Ne** is used with **abbastanza** (enough), **tre** (three), **un pezzo** (a piece): **Ne ho abbastanza** (I have enough).",
      "**Quanti ne vuoi?** (how many do you want?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With verbs of opinion",
     "texto": [
      "With «parlare di» or «pensare di»: **Che ne pensi?** (what do you think about it?), **Ne parliamo dopo** (we talk about it later)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
